msgid ""
"Additional data to write to the current directory. Given as a dict of "
"{filename: data}. Note that if using FireWorks, dictionary keys cannot "
"contain the \".\" character which is typically used to denote file "
"extensions. To avoid this, use the \":\" character, which will "
"automatically be converted to \".\". E.g. ``{\"my_file:txt\": \"contents "
"of the file\"}``."
msgstr ""

