msgid "Per-image BFGS optimizer for NEB calculations."
msgstr ""

#: 34535be830be4582bed887aa2d598190
#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageBFGS:4 of
msgid ""
"This optimizer follows the Lua FLOS approach where each NEB image has its"
" own independent BFGS optimizer with a full inverse Hessian "
"approximation."
msgstr ""

#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageBFGS:7
#: b8cbfcb6a45146dab7ac4956e042c6ad of
msgid ""
"Unlike L-BFGS which only stores recent gradient/position pairs, full BFGS"
" maintains the complete inverse Hessian matrix. This can provide better "
"convergence for smaller systems but uses more memory (O(n²) vs O(n*m))."
msgstr ""

#: 51c9caabe03843679935c87b7531970a
#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageBFGS:11
#: atomate2.siesta.flows.neb.ase_neb.PerImageLBFGS:20
